# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitattributes — bao ve toan ven du lieu khi dong bo VPS <-> may local
#
# `* -text` = TAT hoan toan viec Git tu doi line ending (CRLF <-> LF).
# Ly do: assets/ chua hang nghin file binary dac thu cua Cocos/Spine
# (.skel, .pac, .bin, .fnt, .plist, .atlas...). Neu de Git tu doan
# text/binary, mot file binary bi nhan nham la text se bi convert
# line ending => HONG FILE, game loi asset.
#
# Doi lai: Git luu nguyen xi tung byte nhu tren dia. VPS va may local
# deu la Windows nen hoan toan nhat quan.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

* -text
